    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this beautifully presented three-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment at Apartment 3, Block B, Mellowes Quay. Extending to approximately 93 sq. m. (or 123 sq.m including the private outdoor terrace) this impressive property is presented in turn-key condition throughout and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation in a highly desirable Dublin 8 location.\n\nOn entering, you are greeted by a welcoming hallway which leads to the principal living accommodation. The open-plan living and dining area is particularly impressive, enjoying excellent natural light and a pleasant outlook over the communal grounds. The living space is tastefully finished and provides a comfortable setting for both everyday living and entertaining, with direct access to the private outdoor terrace.\n\nThe modern fitted kitchen is located just off the dining area and is finished with attractive two-tone cabinetry, ample worktop space and integrated appliances. The contemporary finish, combined with the excellent storage provision, makes this a practical and stylish kitchen for modern living. A fitted cabinet for separate washer and dryer provides additional counter-top space in the dining area.\n\nThere are three well-proportioned bedrooms, with the principal bedroom and second bedroom benefiting from fitted wardrobes, pleasant outlooks towards the landscaped grounds, and access to the terrace. The additional bedroom is generously sized and offers excellent flexibility for family living, guests, or a home office.\n\nThe apartment is further complemented by two well-appointed bathrooms, including an ensuite shower room and a separate main bathroom, both finished in a clean and contemporary style.\n\nOne of the standout features of this property is the private paved terrace, which overlooks the attractive communal gardens and provides an ideal outdoor space for relaxing or entertaining. The apartment also benefits from one designated car parking space.\n\nThe property has clearly been exceptionally well maintained and is ready for immediate occupation, with a neutral yet stylish décor throughout. The combination of its generous floor area, ground floor position, private outdoor space and turnkey presentation makes this an excellent opportunity for a wide range of purchasers."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Three-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment</li><li> Approx. 93 sq. m. (1,001 sq. ft.)</li><li> Turn-key condition throughout</li><li> Bright and spacious living/dining accommodation</li><li> Modern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances</li><li> Principal bedroom with fitted wardrobes</li><li> Ensuite shower room</li><li> Contemporary main bathroom</li><li> Private paved terrace overlooking communal grounds</li><li> Attractive landscaped communal gardens</li><li> One designated car parking space</li><li> Well-maintained modern development</li><li> Excellent storage throughout</li><li> Double-glazed windows</li><li> Electric heating</li><li> Ideal owner-occupier or investment opportunity</li><li> Highly convenient Dublin 8 location</ul>"
      },
